  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Parent Portal**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing a parent portal for a home English tutoring center. It\'s crucial this is in Indonesian and mobile-first, targeting parents unfamiliar with technology. I\'m prioritizing user-friendliness, access via a unique link and a 6-digit PIN. The aim is to create a seamless and intuitive experience.\n\n\n**Developing Key Features**\n\nNow, I\'m fleshing out the core features. The child\'s profile, attendance records, a gallery of work samples with captions, and payment information tabs are being designed. I\'m focusing on a clean, single-page design with large fonts, buttons, and high contrast for accessibility. I\'m using Next.js, Tailwind, and TypeScript. The data is currently hardcoded for now, but will eventually connect to Supabase.\n\n\n"
