    thinking: "**Initiating Strategic Planning**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the planning-mode skill. Phase 1 details activating planning mode based on explicit triggers: activation, metadata prompts requesting plans/designs, or the presence of key design, aesthetic, or product requirements. These criteria will inform the system\'s shift to a planning-focused mode.\n\n\n**Refining Query Strategy**\n\nI\'m now integrating a questioning strategy before jumping to conclusions. I will formulate 2-4 multiple-choice questions using the `ask_question` tool, to gather key details. My answers will be concise, and the preferred choices will be marked as \"recommended.\" I won\'t create a detailed plan immediately, aiming for focused information gathering in this first round of interaction.\n\n\n**Designing Payment Upload**\n\nI\'m now designing the payment upload feature for a Next.js App Router + Tailwind + TypeScript app. The design emphasizes large fonts and buttons with high contrast for easy use. I\'m considering a single-page layout without menus. For now, the data is dummy, but I\'ll connect to Supabase later. I\'m exploring an easy-to-use user experience.\n\n\n**Crafting Clarifying Questions**\n\nI\'m now generating clarifying questions to gather specifics. I\'ve formulated three multiple-choice questions with recommended options using `ask_question`. The focus is on gathering essential details about branding, user interface considerations for elderly users, and helpful features for the payment confirmation tab. Formatting ensures plain text with no markdown.\n\n\n"
