  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Student Header**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `StudentProfileHeader` component. I\'m aiming to display the child\'s photo, full name, nickname, and class name (\"Primary English Explorer (Kelas 3 SD)\"). I also need to incorporate the schedule (\"Selasa & Kamis \302\267 15.30 - 17.00 WIB\") and the teacher\'s name. I\'m planning out the component structure.\n\n\n"
