  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining App Features**\n\nI\'m currently outlining the features for `App.tsx`, specifically focusing on how it should handle URL parameters. I\'m thinking it needs to check for a token or student ID, and default to Kenzo if none are present, like `?token=kenzo-404` or `?token=nadira-202`. This logic should be the foundation of the app\'s initial behavior.\n\n\n**Refining UI Structure**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in the authentication flow and the primary dashboard\'s structure. I\'m focusing on the `isUnlocked` state, which drives the rendering of either the `PinLockScreen` or the main parent dashboard, as well as the immediate feedback that will be displayed after a confirmation or upload. I\'m building it from the top-down, starting with the header bar and diving into the component logic. I\'m getting closer to integrating Supabase for tuition data updates.\n\n\n"
