  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising Tab Navigation**\n\nI\'m currently focused on refactoring the `TabNavigation.tsx` component. The user\'s feedback pointed out the tab bar\'s horizontal layout was too cramped, particularly on smaller screens. I\'m aiming to transform it into a vertical menu, making it more accessible and user-friendly. I will be incorporating distinct button elements to enhance the menu\'s visual clarity and usability.\n\n\n**Implementing Vertical Menu**\n\nNow, I\'m fleshing out the vertical menu design. I\'m thinking of incorporating three large, vertical button cards on the main page, each about 68-74px high, with prominent icons and descriptions. One card will highlight attendance, another the gallery, and the last will address tuition. Active states will be clearly indicated with a bold border and a contrasting background.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8557007484897841594"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { CalendarCheck, Image, WalletCards, ChevronRight, CheckCircle2 } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport type ActiveTabType = \'attendance\' | \'gallery\' | \'tuition\';\\n\\ninterface TabNavigationProps {\\n  activeTab: ActiveTabType;\\n  onChangeTab: (tab: ActiveTabType) => void;\\n  unpaidCount: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport const TabNavigation: React.FC<TabNavigationProps> = ({\\n  activeTab,\\n  onChangeTab,\\n  unpaidCount,\\n}) => {\\n  const tabs = [\\n    {\\n      id: \'attendance\' as ActiveTabType,\\n      number: \'1\',\\n      title: \'Absensi & Catatan Guru\',\\n      subtitle: \'Riwayat 8 pekan, kehadiran & evaluasi belajar\',\\n      icon: CalendarCheck,\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'gallery\' as ActiveTabType,\\n      number: \'2\',\\n      title: \'Galeri Karya & Foto Kelas\',\\n      subtitle: \'Lembar kerja tulisan tangan & kegiatan seru\',\\n      icon: Image,\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'tuition\' as ActiveTabType,\\n      number: \'3\',\\n      title: \'Iuran Les & Konfirmasi Bayar\',\\n      subtitle: \'Status 3 bulan, nomor rekening & kirim bukti\',\\n      icon: WalletCards,\\n      badge: unpaidCount > 0 ? `${unpaidCount} Perlu Bayar` : undefined,\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n      {/* 1. Menu Vertikal Menumpuk ke Bawah (Tombol Sangat Besar & Mudah Dipencet) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n          <label className=\\\"text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-slate-800\\\">\\n            Pilih Informasi yang Ingin Dilihat:\\n          </label>\\n          <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500\\\">\\n            Ketuk tombol besar di bawah\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {tabs.map((tab) => {\\n          const Icon = tab.icon;\\n          const isActive = activeTab === tab.id;\\n\\n          return (\\n            <button\\n              key={tab.id}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                onChangeTab(tab.id);\\n                // Scroll lembut ke area konten\\n                const targetEl = document.getElementById(\'tab-content-area\');\\n                if (targetEl) {\\n                  targetEl.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\', block: \'start\' });\\n                }\\n              }}\\n              className={`w-full min-h-[72px] sm:min-h-[78px] p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl border-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left transition-all active:scale-98 select-none shadow-sm ${\\n                isActive\\n                  ? \'bg-blue-950 border-amber-400 text-white shadow-md ring-4 ring-blue-900/20\'\\n                  : \'bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border-slate-300 text-slate-900 hover:border-blue-900\'\\n              }`}\\n              role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n              aria-selected={isActive}\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 flex-1\\\">\\n                {/* Lingkaran Ikon Besar */}\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-13 h-13 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-colors ${\\n                    isActive\\n                      ? \'bg-amber-400 text-blue-950 font-black\'\\n                      : \'bg-blue-100 text-blue-900\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <Icon className=\\\"w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8\\\" />\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                    <span\\n                      className={`text-lg sm:text-xl font-black leading-snug ${\\n                        isActive ? \'text-white\' : \'text-slate-900\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      {tab.title}\\n                    </span>\\n                    {tab.badge && (\\n                      <span className=\\\"bg-rose-500 text-white text-xs font-extrabold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow-xs\\\">\\n                        {tab.badge}\\n                      </span>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n                  <p\\n                    className={`text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium mt-0.5 leading-tight ${\\n                      isActive ? \'text-blue-200\' : \'text-slate-600\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {tab.subtitle}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Status Indicator / Panah */}\\n              <div className=\\\"shrink-0\\\">\\n                {isActive ? (\\n                  <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-blue-950 font-black text-xs sm:text-sm\\\">\\n                    <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-950\\\" />\\n                    <span>Aktif</span>\\n                  </span>\\n                ) : (\\n                  <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" />\\n                  </div>\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n            </button>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* 2. Fixed Bottom Tab Bar di Layar HP (Agar Selalu Mudah Dipencet Tanpa Scroll ke Atas) */}\\n      <nav\\n        className=\\\"fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md border-t-2 border-slate-300 shadow-[0_-4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] pb-safe\\\"\\n        aria-label=\\\"Navigasi Bawah Layar\\\"\\n      >\\n        <div className=\\\"max-w-2xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-3 h-20 items-stretch px-2\\\">\\n          {tabs.map((tab) => {\\n            const Icon = tab.icon;\\n            const isActive = activeTab === tab.id;\\n\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={tab.id}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  onChangeTab(tab.id);\\n                  const targetEl = document.getElementById(\'tab-content-area\');\\n                  if (targetEl) {\\n                    targetEl.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\', block: \'start\' });\\n                  }\\n                }}\\n                className={`flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-1 transition-all select-none active:scale-95 relative ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? \'text-blue-950 font-black bg-amber-50/70 border-t-4 border-blue-950\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 font-bold\'\\n                }`}\\n                aria-selected={isActive}\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                  <Icon\\n                    className={`w-7 h-7 transition-transform ${\\n                      isActive ? \'scale-110 text-blue-950\' : \'text-slate-500\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                  {tab.badge && (\\n                    <span className=\\\"absolute -top-1 -right-2 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500 ring-2 ring-white\\\" />\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n                <span\\n                  className={`text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-tight mt-1 truncate max-w-full px-1 ${\\n                    isActive ? \'font-black text-blue-950\' : \'font-extrabold text-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  {tab.id === \'attendance\' ? \'Absensi\' : tab.id === \'gallery\' ? \'Galeri\' : \'Iuran SPP\'}\\n                </span>\\n              </button>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n      </nav>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update TabNavigation to vertical stacked large buttons plus fixed bottom mobile navigation bar\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/TabNavigation.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update TabNavigation component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\303\022\n\300\022\001i\024}\023pO\t\345\024\332oD\b\273f1W\231\232c\002B\256y\246\210\253\377i#\\s\324\0247\3773\212\345\255\365\001\252%\225\026 G\320\321\r\223^\324:\242\003\314\346\347\216\263M\020\214A\023\260\3238R\200\270\344:\300\3163\356\202\332\025NH\211\271\271\336,<\217\024\264\336\366\202&h$l\r1/\351I\350\255\266\332\226\025\231\217z\215\371\301R\251<\'a\370\302n\233\352T\f\312\307\255e\246@\321\223\001\356\301\024v\264\214Ck\a\252G-\031\024\234\260\2528\242bJ>\\myK\320\307\023\200\271R\376B\356\356\215\027C[\021tS\211fu\304i\226i(\224\000\nN\027{,\032\0304?\360$&R+\374N\3600Q\fv\223\027nxC\347\v\351\r\006m95\303\003f\243SE*\025\000\254\360\200\364\357\301B\204K\000{@P\bZ\320\312\317\304n\271\247d-\353\232\001J6[\304$&\242\230Z\374\2351\037w\273Mjt\377\vqJ\205\352w\300i2\266\315\2409}\315$E!m\036\334\aNM\355\214\235\030\364\307xr\n\313\035\302\037\345Y\021\243\201Z\250\272\264\027d:\224\236^\033P\214\341\265\326A\366\332\305[\254\334\356\032\001wD\n\335S\304\305\3207~0\300@?\024\335?\000\215\223\022\246E\363\bU\260C\237p\370.\016\032\272\223\222\242\211{\211\213\213\266lW \331a\302\375\032\316\217\001\215\342c\215\213\023\326\202\224\t\345\035\213K;\326-w\232R\323\224\3532\275\0343\320\254\361Q\376!wb\227`\361\371A\370\236L\317\351\031\376\177\217\313\a\272}S\265q\270[\357\211e!\v\210\314N\271%\224nyX,\377\261=Dw{\023x\210\216~\365\233\201\247~\372\342\242\035\300\216\325^j%M\vF\v{%?ha*\346\253m0\271\332\224K6-K\214\345\210;zt~\025\005\0364\361\305x\347z\263)\305\270[\317aMc\352K\344\371\352\031\320P\021NeF\203\207\307\'\213\334\373\026*\\\221o\\`l=\200\222o\266\3336\3006T\275\205K\005hySh\177\271]\f\322\252\032\3332\204(\\\313\357\230t\211\247t{\032\203\247\260\030\336;\240\227!/.\006B\206q\366<|,Vd\221\342\276\321\337\357\005\006@|\344Y$\241\356\311\326\213\300\267B\3601M\347wZ\245\350\335=[\335\335\324\314<h\266`\331\372r%\340v\017E\305\227\345\322\302\3104%\037\376A\365\201\375B\021\272\335p\302\242\264$\270\351\300\"\