  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing App.tsx Changes**\n\nI\'m currently reviewing `src/App.tsx`. The primary change involves removing the `isUnlocked` check and eliminating the `PinLockScreen` import and rendering from this file, as per the directive I received. I\'m focusing on ensuring these elements are cleanly removed.\n\n\n"
