  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding New Tabs**\n\nI\'ve just added the \'learning_plan\' tab to `ActiveTabType` in `TabNavigation.tsx`. The relevant line is: `export type ActiveTabType = \'attendance\' | \'learning_plan\' | \'gallery\' | \'tuition\';` Now I\'m taking a look at the Tabs component within the same file.\n\n\n"
