  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Payment Access**\n\nI\'ve been focusing on refining the admin access and payment data display. Specifically, I\'m thinking about the button link to the admin panel from the header. Also, the data presentation post-verification is getting more attention, including the status tab filter for \'Paid\' badges. Finally, I\'ve considered how to handle WhatsApp notifications regarding the payment status change.\n\n\n**Assessing & Planning Execution**\n\nI\'m now deep into assessing available skills, particularly API, persistence, UI, and visual design aspects. I\'m cross-referencing these against the SaaS/Enterprise dashboard design, referencing the relevant files for design, API, and routing table components. A key directive is the Zero Modification Rule; I\'m strictly focused on crafting the implementation plan artifact without any code changes. This is all to inform the creation of the implementation plan artifact.\n\n\n"
