  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing the Plan**\n\nI\'m now in Phase 3, synthesizing requirements after the \"Proceed\" approval. Currently, I\'m focusing on synthesizing all specifications. This includes details for the `/admin` route: an owner dashboard featuring a wide desktop layout, clean neutral colors with green accents, and it must be accessed via URL `/admin`.\n\n\n**Refining Features Details**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on UI details. The admin dashboard now has a \"Kembali ke Portal Wali\" button and features like \"Tabel Konfirmasi Pembayaran Menunggu\" with verification actions. I\'m also planning an \"Upload Galeri\" function, including student selection, image upload, captions, and save functionality, with a corresponding toast notification.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nNow, I\'m defining the data structures for the mock data and components. I\'ve decided to create separate files for mock student data with payment statuses and placeholder images, using Picsum for the image URLs. I\'m focusing on defining component-specific files for proof modals, gallery upload modals, and the admin dashboard, including their respective features and layout details.\n\n\n"
