  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Dashboard Features**\n\nI\'m currently focused on implementing two new features for the Admin Dashboard. The first is a \"Isi Absensi Kelas\" button, which will appear beneath the \"Upload Foto Kegiatan\" button and will open a modal for selecting a class from a dropdown list.\n\n\n**Adding New Features**\n\nI\'ve made progress on the \"Isi Absensi Kelas\" functionality. The modal now allows selecting a class and entering a date, pre-filling today\'s date. I\'ve also implemented the dummy student list with attendance status options (radio buttons) and a \"Simpan Absensi\" button. Upon saving, the modal closes and displays a success toast. I\'ve also added the \"Link Wali\" button next to \"Verifikasi\", which copies the student\'s access link and PIN to the clipboard and shows the corresponding toast notification, ensuring the design remains untouched.\n\n\n"
