  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Summary Display**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on a Summary Card Banner to be placed prominently on the `/admin` page. I think displaying total monthly revenue (based on \'Paid\' status) and the number of overdue invoices will be crucial. I\'m considering the best visual design to make the summary immediately understandable at a glance.\n\n\n**Developing Financial Summary**\n\nI\'m now implementing the design details for the summary display. I\'ve defined a clear title and two primary highlight cards. The first card focuses on total revenue (marked as \'lunas\'), with a prominent figure, an icon, and subtext indicating the verified student count. The second card will present the count and total value of overdue invoices, accompanied by an icon and subtext explaining that they await verification. I\'ve also added a visual collection progress bar.\n\n\n"
